    "summary": "The user asks the assistant for a summary of the consensus regarding the ROI of DEI programs, specifically questioning if they drive performance or are merely performative. The assistant immediately asserts a \"consensus\" that favors positive outcomes, which the user then challenges by citing opposing viewpoints and questioning the level of evidence. The transcript cuts off as the model begins to respond to this challenge.",
